e given parameters). Initial resize can be used as a pseudo reserve, in a similar way as in `append_utf8`. I think that would be faster in most (if not all) cases.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106611#pullrequestreview-2853205265","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106611","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106611#pullrequestreview-2853205265"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106611"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-20T08:27:52Z","commit_id":null}]